{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「──這個嘛，把不懂的地方整理起來，待會拿給我看吧。」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1225", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、嗯嗯！我知道了，謝謝妳！那待會就麻煩妳囉，瀨名同學～」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 295, "voice": "ja0042", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1226", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "約定好待會解答不懂的問題後，瀨名同學走向我和隼太。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈囉小瀨名，妳還是這麼常被請教欸～」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "ht0182", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就說不要叫小瀨名了。」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1227", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「解答同學的問題對自己也有幫助。就這層意義來說，是很值得高興的事喔。」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1228", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那為什麼要『待會』？」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只要把自己不懂的地方挑出來，自己就能大致瞭解到某個程度了吧？」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1229", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名很自然地回答我。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天的她跟昨天截然不同，已經能像以前那樣跟我相處了。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且問人的那方如果不調整成『請教的狀態』，不管我怎麼教都學不會的。」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1230", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就這點來說，教瓜生很輕鬆呢。」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1231", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，是嗎？真是光榮。」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，明明沒有被拜託，還是會想教你的感覺呢。」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1232", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸欸～今天過完就是週末了說，還要念書，拜託饒了我吧～」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，一直念下去早晚會找到樂趣的。」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1233", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "輕鬆而且能開玩笑的氣氛。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不對，或許現在的關係比以前更融洽呢。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天面對我的瀨名非常自然，語氣就像跟朋友說話一樣。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前那種為了不要意識到我是異性而勉強自己的感覺，現在完全沒有了。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～感覺只要誤會一句，就會像SM情侶的對話呢。」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "ht0183", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那是什麼？」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1234", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「SM情侶是什麼？瓜生。」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1235", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「又問這種很難回答的問題……」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼，就由自稱博學多聞的安潔來回答吧！」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "ag0374", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知道是路過還是一直在旁邊聽，安潔突然就這樣冒了出來。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，安潔覺得首先要對『像情侶』這部分有反應比較好吧。」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "ag0375", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「SM的說明呢？去哪裡了？」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "sn0144", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，乾同學也在聽啊。」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說得那麼大聲當然會聽到啊。我還想叫你們不要在我旁邊聊色勒……」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "sn0145", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸、那個……」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1236", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是下流的意思嗎？」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1237", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「算是吧……硬要說的話。」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我還是第一次聊色色的話題……」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1238", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以？結果是什麼意思？」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1239", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還是要問喔！？」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有什麼關係，反正機會難得，告訴我吧。」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1240", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃……就是想欺負的人和想被欺負的人幸福地結合……的意思吧？」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原來如此，就像磁鐵的S極和N極那樣的感覺啊。」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1241", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然我講得很委婉，但瀨名一臉正經地接受了這個說明。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯……這兩位昨天明明那麼不自然的感覺，今天卻相處得很融洽呢……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "ag0376", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還偷偷摸摸講悄悄話……轉變也太激烈了吧。」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "sn0146", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理同學……該不會該不會，昨天又發生了什麼事情嗎？？」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "ag0377", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "另一邊，安潔跟乾同學越來越在意瀨名的反應了。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼，又想說很可疑嗎？」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1242", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是瀨名果然不可同日而語，她輕哼一聲就無視了質疑。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊，雖然希望妳對情侶兩個字有反應也是因為這個原因啦……」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "ag0378", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳們也真是愛猜，隨便妳們怎麼想吧。」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1243", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「輕鬆地迴避話題了！」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "ag0379", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為，想聊色色話題了對吧，瓜生？」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1244", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「剛才那樣算色嗎？算了先不要深究吧。」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼嘛，反正是下流的事吧？那種程度的話題我也是有辦法參與的。」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1245", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是說，她身邊的人像安潔和乾同學都不會跟她聊那方面的話題吧。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為瀨名的個性正經又古板，要是聊那個好像會惹她生氣。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，那種話題她卻可以跟我聊。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對吧，瓜生。」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1246", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……妳今天好像心情很好？」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你還說我？」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "ar1247", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈。」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她也笑了。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我就是想看到這樣的她，所以配合她的說笑。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這樣就好，這正是我期望的，也是我想為她做的。因為瀨名至今為止沒有可以聊這種話題的對象。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果我是「第一個」，那我想要盡全力回應她……", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～我被冷落了～」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 299, "voice": "ht0185", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……又是兩人世界呢。」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "sn0147", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該說，感覺越來越要好了呢……」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "ag0380", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……安潔。」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": "sn0148", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看來要使出非常手段了，小紗同學！」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "ag0381", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
